    <sys:String x:Key="Splash.AcceptText">I have read and accept these terms, and I accept responsibility for the accuracy of the records I produce.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Splash.AgreeUseSoftwareProduceFalseMisleading">You agree not to use this software to produce false, misleading or fraudulent invoices or records, or for any purpose unlawful under UAE federal or emirate law.</sys:String>
