    <sys:String x:Key="Splash.FederalDecreeLawNo452021ProtectionPersonal">Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021 on the Protection of Personal Data applies to personal data you enter, such as customer and contact details. You act as the data controller. If you enable the optional AI assistant with real business data, customer names, project names and amounts are transmitted to a third-party AI provider outside this device. That feature is optional and can be switched off at any time in Settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Splash.FederalDecreeLawNo462021Electronic">Federal Decree-Law No. 46 of 2021 on Electronic Transactions and Trust Services governs electronic records in the UAE. Documents produced here are electronic records; you are responsible for their integrity, storage, and any signature requirements applicable to your business.</sys:String>
