    <sys:String x:Key="Splash.Term9">9. Governing law.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Splash.TermsGovernedLawsUnitedArabEmiratesEmirate">These terms are governed by the laws of the United Arab Emirates and of the Emirate in which you operate. Disputes are subject to the competent UAE courts.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Splash.TermsTitle">TERMS OF USE</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Splash.UAETaxLawRequiresAccountingRecordsTax">UAE tax law requires accounting records and tax invoices to be retained for the statutory period — generally five years, and longer for real-estate records. All data is stored locally on this computer only. Maintaining backups sufficient to meet that obligation is your responsibility.</sys:String>
